#ASSERT `What fine can the sponsor face for supplying my medicine without the document` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE (`the date` 1 1 2010) TRUE EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `What fine can the sponsor face for supplying my medicine without the document` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE (`the date` 1 1 2010) FALSE EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `What fine can the sponsor face for supplying my medicine without the document` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE (`the date` 1 1 1996) FALSE EQUALS 10

