#ASSERT `Could I lawfully be given an unapproved medicine because my life was at risk` `a biological` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `not covered: it was not dispensed on a prescription given in accordance with good medical practice`

-- reg 12A(3): given Monday 2 March 2026; the last day is Monday 30 March 2026.
