#ASSERT `Was the statement about me sent in time` TRUE (`the date` 2 3 2026) TRUE (`the date` 31 3 2026) (`the date` 1 6 2026) EQUALS `not done in time`
#ASSERT `Was the statement about me sent in time` TRUE (`the date` 2 3 2026) TRUE (`the date` 2 3 2026) (`the date` 1 6 2026) EQUALS `done in time`
