§ `A medicine I imported, or that was compounded for me (Schedule 5 items 1 and 6)`

-- Exactly 3 months in this importation and exactly 15 in the 12 months: within both limits.
#ASSERT `Can I import this medicine for my own treatment` `my own` `a medicine` FALSE FALSE FALSE 3 15 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `exempt under item 1 of Schedule 5`
#ASSERT `Can I import this medicine for my own treatment` `my own` `a medicine` FALSE FALSE FALSE 3.5 15 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `not exempt: more than 3 months' supply in one importation`
#ASSERT `Can I import this medicine for my own treatment` `my own` `a medicine` FALSE FALSE FALSE 3 15.5 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `not exempt: more than 15 months' supply in 12 months`
